{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0147","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000000f4:text","row":25403,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"みょー。（最中）","en":"Psssss. (Midstream.)","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008857","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00001","en":"Pyyyy. (-ing)","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000124:text","row":25404,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふう」","en":"“Whew.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008858","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Whew.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000169:text","row":25405,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なんの相談もなく」","en":"“...Without so much as consulting me.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008859","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00003","en":"Touko: \"...without any consultation.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000248:text","row":25406,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「ッッッッ！！？？」","en":"“—!!!??”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008860","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00004","en":"Taichi: \"!!!!?!?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:0000035e:text","row":25407,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"死ぬほどビビった。","en":"I nearly died of fright.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008861","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00005","en":"I was deathly jittery.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000390:text","row":25408,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「……よ、曜子ちゃん」","en":"“...Y-Youko.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008862","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00006","en":"Taichi: \"...Yo-, Youko-chan.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000003e3:text","row":25409,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「恋愛ごっこでもしてるの？」","en":"“Playing at romance again, are you?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008863","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00007","en":"Youko: \"Playing pretend-a-lovers?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000417:text","row":25410,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"抑揚のない口調でそう言う。","en":"Her voice was perfectly flat.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008864","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00008","en":"She says in a flat monotone.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000451:text","row":25411,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「あのさ、気配もなく背後に忍び寄るのやめてくれない？」","en":"“Could you stop materializing behind me without making a sound?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008865","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00009","en":"Taichi: \"You know, could you please stop doing the shinobi act all the way up to people's backs without even a hint of presence?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000004a7:text","row":25412,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008866","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00010","en":"Youko: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000004cf:text","row":25413,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「もし心臓止まったらどうするのさ」","en":"“What if my heart stopped?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008867","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00011","en":"Taichi: \"What would you do if you stopped my heart!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:0000052e:text","row":25414,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一の心臓が……そう簡単に止まるはず……ない」","en":"“...Your heart... isn’t going to stop... that easily.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008868","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00012","en":"Youko: \"...Taichi's heart... stopping so easily... can't be.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000582:text","row":25415,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「失敬な！」","en":"“Excuse you!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008869","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Well, that's rude!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000005cb:text","row":25416,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「私に内緒で、どうせい」","en":"“Living together behind my back.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008870","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00014","en":"Youko: \"Cohabitation in secret from me.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000603:text","row":25417,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「どーして曜子ちゃんの許可取る必要があるわけさ」","en":"“Why should I need your permission?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008871","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Whyyy do I even need your permission now, Youko-chan!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:0000064b:text","row":25418,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"鏡の中の瞳が、微妙に潤む。","en":"In the mirror, her eyes glistened ever so slightly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008872","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00016","en":"The eyes inside of the mirror dampen subtly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:0000067d:text","row":25419,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"本当に微妙に。","en":"And I do mean slightly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008873","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00017","en":"Truly and well subtly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000006ab:text","row":25420,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに自分で言ってたじゃないか。恋愛ごっこって」","en":"“You said it yourself, remember? Playing at romance.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008874","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00018","en":"Taichi: \"And didn't you just say it yourself. It's pretend-a-lovers.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000006fd:text","row":25421,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「君がそうとらえているんなら、特に問題ないはずだ。ごっこ遊びにいちいち目くじら立てる理由はないものな？」","en":"“If that’s all it is to you, there shouldn’t be a problem. No reason to get bent out of shape over make-believe, right?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008875","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00019","en":"Taichi: \"If you can understand that much, there shouldn't be any particular problem. There's no reason to be all upset about every single little pretend-playing, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:0000077d:text","row":25422,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"かすかに彼女が逡巡する。","en":"She hesitated—barely.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008876","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00020","en":"An indistinct hesitation in her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000007d2:text","row":25423,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……だって、太一は前もこんなことして……失敗してる」","en":"“...But you tried this before... and failed.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008877","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00021","en":"Taichi: \"...but, you have done this before, Taichi... it was a mistake.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000828:text","row":25424,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「あのときとは状況が違う」","en":"“Things were different then.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008878","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00022","en":"Taichi: \"The situation back then was different.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000862:text","row":25425,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに冬子のこと、俺かなり責任あるし」","en":"“Besides, I bear a lot of responsibility for Touko.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008879","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00023","en":"Taichi: \"And because of that, I have a good amount of responsibility to Touko.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000008aa:text","row":25426,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「……もしかしたら、今の生活が落ち着いて冬子もちょっと自立できるようになるかも知れない。そしたらいったん仕切り直しにしてもいいし」","en":"“...Maybe once we settle into this life and Touko learns to stand on her own a little, we can start over from scratch.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008880","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00024","en":"Taichi: \"...and there's the possibility, that once things settle down with the life we have now, that she could even gain some measure of independence. Then I'll be fine with going back to the starting mark once again.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000969:text","row":25427,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「……その可能性は低い」","en":"“...I don’t think that’s very likely.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008881","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00025","en":"Youko: \"...low probabilities of that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000009a1:text","row":25428,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「だからもしかしたらって言ったじゃん」","en":"“That’s why I said maybe.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008882","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00026","en":"Taichi: \"That's why I said that there was just the possibility, really.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:000009e7:text","row":25429,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008883","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00027","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000a0b:text","row":25430,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"納得したか否か。","en":"Whether she believed me or not,","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008884","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00028","en":"Maybe she assents, maybe not.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000a33:text","row":25431,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"整った顔立ちからはうかがい知ることはできない。","en":"her flawless features gave nothing away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008885","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00029","en":"Divining an answer from those flawlessly regulated features is impossible.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000a79:text","row":25432,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女は基本的に、徹底したポーカーフェイスだ。","en":"She was almost always utterly poker-faced.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008886","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00030","en":"Fundamentally, she has a thorough poker face.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000abd:text","row":25433,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"基本的には。","en":"Almost always.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008887","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00031","en":"Fundamentally.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000b06:text","row":25434,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「肉欲がおさえきれないなら」","en":"“If you can’t contain your lust—”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008888","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00032","en":"Youko: \"If carnal desires were to become uncontainable...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000b42:text","row":25435,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「その話は」","en":"“That’s enough.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008889","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00033","en":"Taichi: \"That thing again.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000b66:text","row":25436,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"強くさえぎる。","en":"I cut her off sharply.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008890","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00034","en":"I interrupt her, with strength.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000b94:text","row":25437,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「やめておこう。今俺は冬子とつきあってるんだから」","en":"“Let’s not go there. I’m with Touko now.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008891","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00035","en":"Taichi: \"Just drop it. Right now I am going out with Touko, that's it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000c03:text","row":25438,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「……そう」","en":"“...I see.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008892","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00036","en":"Youko: \"...indeed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000cff:text","row":25439,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"唐突に、彼女は立ち去る。","en":"Without another word, she abruptly walked away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008893","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00037","en":"She leaves, abruptly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000d2f:text","row":25440,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"視界から消えると同時に、その独特の存在感が消失する。","en":"The instant she left my sight, her peculiar presence vanished with her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008894","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00038","en":"The instant she vanishes from the field of view, so her characteristic felt presence vanishes.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000d7b:text","row":25441,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"自分で気配を絶った。","en":"She had erased it herself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008895","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00039","en":"All indications of presence suppressed, all by her own.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000da7:text","row":25442,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"そういうことのできる子だ。","en":"She was capable of that.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008896","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00040","en":"That is just something she is capable of doing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000de1:text","row":25443,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「はぁぁぁ……」","en":"“Haaaaah...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008897","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Siiiigh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0147:00000e0e:text","row":25444,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"疲れた。","en":"I was exhausted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:008898","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2011:00042","en":"So tired.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
